<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria to offer 500 mln levs 3-yr T-notes Dec 13.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria to offer 500 mln levs 3-yr T-notes Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 500 million levs of three-year floater coupon T-notes at an auction on Friday, the central bank (BNB) said.</p>
<p>The issue will be offered with no minimum acceptable price set in advance by the ministry.</p>
<p>The semi-annual coupon equals the BNB's central interest rate (CIR) for the period to maturity. The CIR is now set at 15 percent monthly or 180 percent annually.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 2033096129</p>
<p> Auction date	 December 13, 1996</p>
<p> Issue date	   December 19, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date	December 16, 1999</p>
<p>Interest payments: June 19, 1997; December 18, 1997</p>
<p>			  June 18, 1998; December 17, 1998</p>
<p>			  June 17, 1999; December 16, 1999</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
